---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="News | The Fuzztones"
  description="Latest news, releases and announcements from The Fuzztones."
>
  <main>
    <header class="page-header page-header--news">
      <span class="page-header__eyebrow">The Fuzztones</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">News</h1>
      <div class="page-header__rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </header>

    <section class="news-page">
      <article class="news-item news-item--featured">
        <div class="news-item__image">
          <img
            src="/assets/images/cards/news-halloween-berlin.jpg"
            alt="The Fuzztones Halloween show in Berlin"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="news-item__content">
          <span class="news-item__label">Featured</span>

          <h2>The Fuzztones — Halloween in Berlin</h2>

          <p class="news-item__date">October 31, 2026</p>

          <p>The Fuzztones return to Berlin for Halloween night at BI NUU.</p>

          <a
            href="https://hoochiekoo.us5.list-manage.com/subscribe?u=9b3912f7178474c83082a0ee9&id=b717cc285a"
            class="latest-news__button latest-news__button--primary"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Tickets
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="news-item" id="just-once">
        <div class="news-item__image">
          <img
            src="/assets/images/cards/fuzztones-vinyl-just-once.png"
            alt="The Fuzztones Just Once purple marble vinyl LP"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="news-item__content">
          <span class="news-item__label">New Release</span>

          <p class="news-item__tagline">
            <em>New Fuzztones LP out soon!</em>
          </p>

          <h2>The Fuzztones — Just Once</h2>

          <p class="news-item__date">November 6, 2026</p>

          <p>
            A wonderfully odd collection for serious Fuzztones fans! <em
              >Just Once</em
            >
            digs into the band's live archives for a selection of rare performances
            of songs that The Fuzztones apparently played live just once - exactly
            the sort of stuff that would otherwise remain buried on old tapes and
            in the memories of whoever happened to be in the room that night.
          </p>

          <p>
            The Fuzztones were never a band to play the exact same show night
            after night, and this collection catches them tackling songs well
            outside the usual set. Early rock'n'roll and garage standards are
            dragged through the band's unmistakable fuzz-and-Farfisa treatment,
            including
            <em>Louie Louie</em> and Them's <em>Baby, Please Don't Go</em>.
          </p>

          <p>
            Rather than another greatest-hits collection, this is a proper
            archive dig: vintage live Fuzztones, unusual songs and one-off
            moments from a band whose shows have always been gloriously
            unpredictable.
          </p>

          <p>
            <strong
              >A collection of performances played once - and only once!</strong
            >
          </p>

          <p>
            <strong>ON CLEOPATRA RECORDS!</strong>
          </p>

          <p>
            <strong>SCHEDULED RELEASE DATE NOVEMBER 6, 2026</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="news-item" id="fuzztones-vs-the-world">
        <div class="news-item__image">
          <img
            src="/assets/images/cards/news-fuzztones-vs-the-world-dvd.png"
            alt="The Fuzztones vs The World documentary"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="news-item__content">
          <span class="news-item__label">New Release</span>

          <p class="news-item__tagline">
            <em>A tale of sex, LSD, and rock n roll</em>
          </p>

          <h2>The Fuzztones vs The World — Coming to DVD</h2>

          <p class="news-item__date">November 10, 2026</p>

          <p>
            <em>The Fuzztones vs The World</em> chronicles the highs and lows of an
            extraordinary band whose career has spanned more than four decades of
            Garage Rock.
          </p>

          <p>
            Formed in New York City in 1980, The Fuzztones helped redefine
            Psychedelic Punk and sparked a new garage rock scene, driven by the
            uncompromising vision of Rudi Protrudi.
          </p>

          <p>The documentary arrives on DVD November 10, 2026.</p>

          <div class="news-item__actions">
            <a
              href="/media#fuzztones-vs-the-world"
              class="latest-news__button latest-news__button--primary"
            >
              More Info + Official Trailer →
            </a>

            <a
              href="https://www.imdb.com/title/tt33337078/"
              class="latest-news__button latest-news__button--primary"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              IMDb
            </a>
          </div>

          <p class="news-item__note">
            Purchase information and further details coming soon.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
